      "argument": "--batch-key",
      "datalist": [],
      "help": "If specified, highly-variable genes are selected within each batch separately and merged. This simple process avoids the selection of batch-specific genes and acts as a lightweight batch correction method. For all flavors, genes are first sorted by how many batches they are a HVG. For dispersion-based flavors ties are broken by normalized dispersion. If flavor = 'seurat_v3', ties are broken by the median (across batches) rank based on within-batch normalized variance.",
